### List users
# Responses and templating features. Try:
#   curl localhost:8080/users
#   curl localhost:8080/users/1      (and /users/2 for a 404)
#   curl -N localhost:8080/events
#   curl localhost:8080/flaky
@seed = demo
GET /users
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {{#repeat 3 6}}
  {"id": {{$index | add 1}}, "name": "{{$name}}", "email": "{{$email | lower}}"}
  {{/repeat}}
]

### User by id
GET /users/:id
Content-Type: application/json

< ./users/{{$path.id}}.json

### [201] Create order
POST /orders
Location: /orders/{{$uuid | keep}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "{{$uuid | keep}}", "note": {{$json.note | default "" | json}}}

### Progress events
@stream = 300ms
GET /events
Content-Type: text/event-stream

{{#repeat 5}}
data: {"step": {{$index}}}

{{/repeat}}

### Flaky endpoint
@delay = 100ms..800ms
@fault = reset 30%
GET /flaky

ok

### Literal template
@template = off
GET /docs/template

Write {{$name}} to insert a generated name.
